{"id":"n28298-1-7","stage":3,"title":"끼어들다 · 插入","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28298-1-7-1","ko":"너희 둘 그만 싸워.","zh":"你们俩别再打架了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"둘","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}},{"text":"그만","meaning":"就那些，到此为止","explanation":"그만：就那些，到此为止","readings":[{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36428","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}},{"text":"싸워.","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸워","audio":"/audio/791719d16d2c060546d9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3","entryId":"34869","definition":"一加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["둘ː"]},{"id":"38c09c96aa077d27","term":"그만","zh":"就那些，到此为止","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3","entryId":"36428","definition":"就到那个程度。","pronunciation":["그만"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a8b98cb645df370828e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28298-1-7-2","ko":"우리가 알아서 할 테니까 너는 우리 문제에 끼어들지 마.","zh":"我们自己会处理，你不要插手我们的问题。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"알아서","meaning":"自己处理、自行决定","explanation":"알다：自己处理、自行决定；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"4","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아서","audio":"/audio/697920d26a64e7313e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"테니까","meaning":"表示打算、推测或意志。","explanation":"터：表示打算、推测或意志。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"터","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72183","senseId":"1","lemma":"터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"테니까","audio":"/audio/50bfab96e64a92cb0e7f.mp3"}},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"문제에","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"2","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제에","audio":"/audio/83a94734b39e5a6108ad.mp3"}},{"text":"끼어들지","meaning":"插入，加塞，插话，插手","explanation":"끼어들다：插入，加塞，插话，插手；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"끼어들다","audio":"/audio/6f767240f08aca33487b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28298","senseId":"1","lemma":"끼어들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끼어들지","audio":"/audio/684cbd492026943505ad.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"自己处理、自行决定","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"自己处理、自行决定","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"cfabc7b0ff6f800c","term":"터","zh":"表示打算、推测或意志。","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3","entryId":"72183","definition":"表示打算、推测或意志。","pronunciation":["터"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"成为争论、讨论或研究等对象的事宜。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"6f767240f08aca33","term":"끼어들다","zh":"插入，加塞，插话，插手","audio":"/audio/6f767240f08aca33487b.mp3","entryId":"28298","definition":"挤入别人的位置或顺序等里。","pronunciation":["끼어들다","끼여들다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f1c918e139c291d78e6f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28298","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你们俩别再打架了。","我们自己会处理，你不要插手我们的问题。","我点了披萨，给你留了几块当你的份哦。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你们俩别再打架了。","我们自己会处理，你不要插手我们的问题。","我点了披萨，给你留了几块当你的份哦。"],"answer":1}]}
